config DEMO_I2C_MUX
	tristate "Educational four-channel I2C mux"
	depends on I2C && I2C_MUX
	help
	  Build a study-only driver for the fictional demo,quad-i2c-mux.

	  The device uses a one-byte, one-hot channel selector. This example
	  demonstrates i2c-mux-core integration and parent-locked callbacks; it
	  must not be used for real hardware without a datasheet-based rewrite.
